<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es" class="h-full bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-950">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title><%= title || 'Nueva Plantilla' %> - WhatsApp Bot Admin</title>

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <script>
    tailwind.config = {
      theme: {
        extend: {
          fontFamily: { sans: ['Inter','ui-sans-serif','system-ui'] },
          colors: {
            primary: { DEFAULT:'#1e3a8a',600:'#1e3a8a',700:'#1e40af' },
          },
          boxShadow: {
            soft:'0 10px 25px -10px rgba(0,0,0,.15)',
          }
        }
      },
      darkMode:'media'
    }
  </script>
</head>

<body class="min-h-screen text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 flex items-start justify-center p-6">
  <main class="w-full max-w-xl rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 shadow-soft border border-slate-100/70 dark:border-white/5 p-6">
    <header class="mb-5">
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-extrabold flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
        <span class="inline-flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary font-bold text-sm">📝</span>
        Nueva plantilla
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
        Crea una plantilla reutilizable. Puedes usar variables como {nombre}.
      </p>
    </header>

    <form method="POST" action="/templates/api" class="space-y-4">
      <div>
        <label class="block text-sm font-medium mb-1">Nombre interno</label>
        <input name="name"
               class="w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 px-3 py-2 text-sm outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/50"
               required />
      </div>

      <div>
        <label class="block text-sm font-medium mb-1">Categoría</label>
        <input name="category"
               class="w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 px-3 py-2 text-sm outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/50"
               placeholder="seguimiento, bienvenida, prospección..."
               required />
      </div>

      <div>
        <label class="block text-sm font-medium mb-1">Contenido</label>
        <textarea name="content"
                  rows="5"
                  class="w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 px-3 py-2 text-sm outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/50"
                  placeholder="Hola {nombre}, gracias por escribirnos..."
                  required></textarea>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <input id="isActive"
               name="isActive"
               type="checkbox"
               value="true"
               checked
               class="h-4 w-4 rounded border-slate-300 text-primary focus:ring-primary" />
        <label for="isActive" class="text-sm font-medium">Activa</label>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-center justify-between pt-4">
        <a href="/templates"
           class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm rounded-lg px-3 py-2 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-200 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 transition">
          ← Volver
        </a>

        <button type="submit"
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm rounded-lg px-4 py-2 bg-primary text-white font-semibold shadow-soft hover:bg-primary-700 transition">
          Guardar plantilla
        </button>
      </div>
    </form>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
